config TI_ADS1262
	tristate "Texas Instruments ADS1262 ADC driver"
	depends on SPI
	depends on IIO
	select IIO_BUFFER
	select IIO_TRIGGERED_BUFFER
	help
	  Say yes here to build support for Texas Instruments ADS1262
	  11 channel ADC with internal temperature sensor.

	  To compile this driver as a module, choose M here: the
	  module will be called ads1262.

